## Security

- Never write to `~/.ssh`, `~/.aws`, `~/.gnupg`, or any secret store.
- `scripts/check-secrets-staged.sh` runs on every Write.
- Tenant isolation: every multi-tenant table has `tenant_id` from day one.
- Audit log is append-only (actor, tenant, resource, action, before/after hash).

